WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,590
OK, I'll listen to you.

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:06,910
You are very smart, so it will be easier for us all to get along in the future.

3
00:00:06,910 --> 00:00:12,910
You should understand what kind of purgatory it is outside. You have no other way to survive except to rely on me.

4
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:14,712
so now

5
00:00:14,712 --> 00:00:18,767
I want to tell you a secret

6
00:00:18,767 --> 00:00:21,020
Listen carefully

7
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:24,980
Secret? Are you willing to tell me?

8
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:29,010
I tell you this secret to ensure your absolute loyalty to me.

9
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:32,230
But even if you leak the secret, I'm not afraid.

10
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:36,230
After all, it is difficult for everyone to protect themselves in this world, and I am not afraid of anyone who can pose a threat to me.

11
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:39,230
I have killed everyone who tried to kill me before.

12
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:43,230
I believe you have also seen the reasons for this blood disaster on the Internet.

13
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:47,390
It was caused by the explosion of the super star.
